      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's good to hear. I hope your family is taking care of themselves as well, and that any stress was outweighed by success.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T16:14:14.022451+00:00"
    },
    {
